    [
     1,
     "Thank you Chris for the clarification. In this specific case,I replaced - and adapted - pnorm by phi and there was no longer any derivability issue.<div><br><div>Frédéric<br><br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"auto\" class=\"gmail_attr\">Le jeudi 22 février 2024 à 17:27:33 UTC+1, Chris Paciorek a écrit :<br></div><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Frédéric,<div><br></div><div>It&#39;s the case that nimble&#39;s AD system does not provide derivatives for cumulative distribution (&#39;p&#39;) and quantile (&#39;q&#39;) functions at the moment (which affects use of truncated distributions). We don&#39;t have a firm plan at the moment for when we&#39;ll add that capability. </div><div><br></div><div>-chris</div></div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_attr\">On Wed, Feb 14, 2024 at 6:52 AM <a rel=\"nofollow\">frederic....@gmail.com</a> &lt;<a rel=\"nofollow\">frederic....@gmail.com</a>&gt; wrote:<br></div></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">Dear all,<div><br></div><div>I met another issue while using buildLaplace (catually: just before): this is that derivatives cannont be calculated on some functions in the Nimble code. In the specific case I met, this was strange because the function was pnorm which is differentiable.</div><div><br></div><div>Here is a (maybe silly) code to replicate the issue:</div><div><br></div><div><p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:Calibri;font-size:11pt\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\">library(nimble)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">pumpCode </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> nimbleCode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">({</span><span style=\"color:black\"> <br>\r\n  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,119,170)\">for </span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">i </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,119,170)\">in </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">:</span><span style=\"color:black\">N</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">){</span><span style=\"color:black\"><br>\r\n    theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">] </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dnorm(alpha,exp(beta))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">    lambda</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">] </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pnorm(0,theta</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">],2.0)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">    #x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">] </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dpois</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">4.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">) # does not work</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0in 0.375in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">x</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">] </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dbern</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">lambda</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">[</span><span style=\"color:black\">i</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">])</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">  </span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">}</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">  #alpha </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dexp</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">  #beta </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dgamma</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">alpha </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dnorm</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(0.0,</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">  beta </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">~</span><span style=\"color:black\"> dnorm</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.0</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(151,151,151)\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(151,151,151)\">})</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:black\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">pumpConsts </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">N </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">= </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">10</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> t </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> c</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">94.3</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">15.7</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">62.9</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">126</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">5.24</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">31.4</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.05</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">1.05</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">2.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">, </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">10.5</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:rgb(151,151,151)\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:black\">set.seed(1)</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:black\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">pumpData </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">x </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> rbinom(10,1,0.5)</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:black\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">pumpInits </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> list</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">alpha </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">= </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> beta </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">= </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> theta </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> rep</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">0.1</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pumpConsts</span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">$</span><span style=\"color:black\">N</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">))</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt;color:black\"> </p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><span style=\"color:black\">pump </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:black\"> nimbleModel</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">(</span><span style=\"color:black\">code </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pumpCode</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> name </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">= </span><span style=\"color:rgb(102,153,0)\">&quot;pump&quot;</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> constants </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pumpConsts</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> <br>\r\n                    data </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pumpData</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> inits </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">=</span><span style=\"color:black\"> pumpInits</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">,</span><span style=\"color:black\"> buildDerivs </span><span style=\"color:rgb(154,110,58)\">= </span><span style=\"color:rgb(153,0,85)\">TRUE</span><span style=\"color:rgb(151,151,151)\">)</span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:11pt\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\"><font face=\"Sans Serif\">I then get the message:</font></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\">[Warning] function pnorm is not supported for derivatives.<br>This model will not compile. ...<font face=\"Sans Serif\"><br></font></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\">Is it planned to incorporate more functions in the derivative capabilities of nimble/buildLapalace?</p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\">Sincerely,</p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\"><br></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:11pt\">Frédéric</p></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 0.8ex;border-left:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding-left:1ex\">\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;nimble-users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a rel=\"nofollow\">nimble-users...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/4f05e7ae-abea-43a6-a6ca-991cb0506816n%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/4f05e7ae-abea-43a6-a6ca-991cb0506816n%2540googlegroups.com?utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_source%3Dfooter&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792475552109000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2KkhhRT4QkAPIyV9dRxQxJ\">https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/nimble-users/4f05e7ae-abea-43a6-a6ca-991cb0506816n%40googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\n</blockquote></div>\r\n</blockquote></div>"
